					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Consul noster rediit, affirmat nihil plane de concilio <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>resciri posse.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Fuit in comitatu praepositus huius <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>collegii papista, qui affirmat abbatem <persName>Eremi</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>domum revertisse (de quo dubito, licet ille affirmet; <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>tu scire potes) et id argumento esse nihil <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>nunc memorabile agi, maxime quod abbas <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>gloriatus sit se illuc reversurum, si resumantur <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>negotia ecclesiae; ea enim se lege discessisse, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>ut sit ab illis revocandus.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><persName>Dietägius</persName> dicit <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>(sed hic multa vana dicit, affirmant tamen <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>et hoc alii) Cęsarem cogitare de resignando <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>imperio filio domumque, quam <placeName ref="l232">Oeniponti</placeName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><placeName ref="l232">Innsbruck</placeName>.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>pro Iesuitis ędificarit, sibi privato usurpare <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>cogitare ad exemplum fratris Caroli etc.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Alii <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>dicunt eum <placeName ref="l361">Norinbergę</placeName> expectari, non <placeName ref="l18">Augustae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>et quod propter nundinas <placeName ref="l157">Franckfortenses</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>res nonnihil differatur; illinc enim <placeName ref="l157">Franckfortum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>eum concessurum.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Hac sunt, quae dicuntur; <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>sed incipio nihil credere; nam <persName ref="p8093">Hercules</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>quae scripserit, nosti.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Postea per idem tempus mercatores <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>omnes, qui ex <placeName ref="l834">Italia</placeName> venerunt, id ipsum constanter <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>affirmarunt; nunc sunt, qui negent castellum <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>captum, sed inter <placeName ref="l150">Ferrariensem</placeName> et <placeName ref="l1098">Florentinum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>simultatem et contentionem esse de finibus <lb xml:id="p1z25"/><placeName>Tusciam</placeName> versus.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Scribitur <placeName ref="l55">Bononię</placeName> tumultuatos <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>cives contra pontificem, cuius accusarint <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>tyrannidem.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Tu, quaeso, scribe, quid 5 Pagici <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>moliantur; fortassis haec causa est, quod <placeName ref="l41">Bernenses</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>suos nolint ulterius progredi.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Audio legatos <lb xml:id="p1z30"/><placeName ref="l832">Gallos</placeName> ad vos venisse, an a <persName ref="p20225">Guisio</persName> an <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>vero a <persName ref="p8315">Condensi</persName>, dubito.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8315">Condensis</persName> dicitur <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>copias distribuisse in castella et expectare auxilia.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z33"/>Tu, quaeso, nos libera ab hisce dubiis.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>Vale, reverende pater.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Die quo cętera.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l98">Curię</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z35"/>Salutat te officiose d. c[onsul] <lb xml:id="p1z37"/><persName ref="p3196">Tscharnerus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse fehlt.]</note>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
